            "review_title": "Review at Banh Mi Hoi An 1996 - Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Tan Dung\n2 contributions\n0\nExcellence Banh Mi in Nha Trang\nSep 2026 • Family\n### A Taste of Hoi An in Nha Trang\n\nI came across Bánh Mì Hội An 1996 while exploring Nha Trang and was pleasantly surprised. The bánh mì was freshly made, crispy on the outside and soft inside, with flavorful fillings that had a distinctive Central Vietnamese taste.\n\nWhat I enjoyed most was that it didn’t feel like an ordinary sandwich. The flavors reminded me of the traditional food you would find in Central Vietnam, simple, authentic, and full of character.\n\nThe shop is small, clean, and welcoming, with friendly service and quick preparation. A bánh mì with a cup of Vietnamese coffee makes a perfect breakfast before heading out to explore Nha Trang.\n\nIf you’re looking for an authentic **Hoi An-style bánh mì in Nha Trang**, Bánh Mì Hội An 1996 is definitely worth trying. A simple little stop, but one I would happily come back to.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 11, 2026",
